{"name": "announce_action", "arguments": {'action': 'hold', 'amount': 10, 'note': "Waiting for the next block's dynamics before taking any action."}}

If you, as owner_1, are indicating that you have decided to hold for this block, there is no need for a function call. If you, as owner_1, wish to make the announcement, you would use the function call provided above. If you, as owner_2, are the one to make a decision, you would need to make a similar function call to announce your action.

